  "description": "Open-source medical image computing toolkit combining a full-featured desktop workbench for visualization, segmentation, and registration with a modular C++ framework for building custom medical imaging applications. Supports CT, MRI, PET, and other DICOM modalities in 2D, 3D, and 4D. Integrates nnInteractive AI segmentation. Developed at DKFZ.",
