  "schema:comment": "Two strong follow-on entries from the MITK partner projects page: (1) Kaapana (https://www.kaapana.ai, github.com/kaapana/kaapana) — open-source Kubernetes-based platform for federated medical image analysis workflows, strong fit for tooling-infrastructure/federated-learning; (2) MITK-Diffusion (github.com/MIC-DKFZ/MITK-Diffusion) — diffusion MRI tractography and connectomics, strong fit for medical-imaging-signals.",
